# Tome of the Dead B10 open-door jambs + lair exit grate — APPROVED by user 2026-10-03 (option B).
# Format = tools/gfx_convert.py --mode tile (same as door.tiles).
# Open door (plan B10): the opening rows 9s+2..9s+7 stamp door_jamb_l / door_jamb_r instead
# of AIR. Both are NON-solid, ink $06 on black like the arch. One glyph per side, repeated
# down all 6 opening rows.
#   door_jamb_l      = APPROVED (user 2026-10-03, option B): arch outer double stroke
#                      (cols 0,2) continued. Common id 11 T_DOOR_JAMB_L.
#   door_jamb_r      = APPROVED: arch outer double stroke (cols 5,7). Common id 14 T_DOOR_JAMB_R.
#   door_jamb_l_leaf = REJECTED option A (open leaf edge-on + hinge strap); review HTML only,
#                      never packed.
# Grate (T_GRATE, id 26, APPROVED): per game.md §1.1/§3.3 and concept-screen §3.3 the lair grate lies
# OVER the down-exit hole {c,2} in floor row 17 (3x1, one glyph repeated, attr $07). Side
# view: top bar (walkable), crossbar, 2-px iron bars with the black shaft between them.
